  "description": "A pure managed .NET library for reading and writing Dolphin RVZ/WIA disc images and\n            decoding the legacy GameCube/Wii formats (GCZ, CISO/WBI, WBFS, TGC, NFS) to a canonical\n            ISO view. Written by Peterson Fernandes (Pure Logic Code); the RVZ/WIA format logic is\n            derived from Dolphin and the library is GPL-2.0-or-later, like Dolphin itself.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
  "id": "RVZSharp",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-10-09T22:00:24.787Z",
  "licenseExpression": "GPL-2.0-or-later",
  "licenseUrl": "https://licenses.nuget.org/GPL-2.0-or-later",
  "listed": true,
  "packageHash": "s3YXF4rjGXHoXClXr/WjiqeIcbOAn59Ge661QHZohEdMQ7cN1tcTWN/LkKMRhznsOgT3G03MWAfeIkr04jSseA==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 1237268,
  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/purelogiccode/RVZSharp",
  "published": "2026-10-09T21:57:42.02Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.1.0: legacy writers (CisoWriter, WbfsWriter, TgcWriter), the DiscVerifier Wii\n            hash-tree/TMD/H3 verifier, thread-safe ReadAt with an LRU cache, the async API,\n            split plain ISO, DiscInfo, BlobStream and scrub options; CLI --json output, -\n            stdin/stdout piping and shell completions; CI with API-compat validation and an\n            embedded SPDX SBOM. Fixes: partition keys are common-key decrypted from the ticket\n            (verify/extract work on real encrypted discs), extract TMD/cert/H3 offsets, WBFS\n            header size/disc-header copy, convert --json stdout hygiene, Ctrl+C exit 130 and\n            monotonic writer progress. Public API stays compatible with 1.0.0.",
